    </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n           湿的咖啡鲜果铺成3厘米厚度的薄薄的一层，在非洲式晾晒床上日晒4天来去除多余的水分。咖啡鲜果在非洲床上晾晒17天，然后被铺成薄薄的一层在非洲床上再次晾晒18天。在整个干燥处理的过程中要避免咖啡鲜果的果皮温度超过40摄氏度的高温。研究表明，当温度超过40摄氏度时，咖啡鲜果中的蛋白质含量会受到影响，总\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n           处理时间为35天\n          </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n             //\n             <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n              圣塔菲丽莎-青山庄园\n              <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n                African Gesha\n               </span>\n               Lot88 日晒\n              </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           品种：非洲种瑰夏 African Gesha\n          </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n            庄园\n           </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n            ：圣塔菲丽莎-青山庄园\n           </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           海拔：1550米 masl\n          </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           批次：88\n          </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n            处理方式：日晒 Natural\n           </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           风味：\n           <span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n            花香、黄柠檬、柚子、葡萄\n           </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n            Floral, Lemon, Pomelo, Grape\n           </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n            这只非洲种瑰夏与小矮人的风味（香气）调性相似，差异就是它的整体酸度酸感要更高更扎实一些～\n            <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n           这是圣塔菲丽莎-青山庄园的微型地块，这个瑰夏种植区开垦于2012年，平均种植面积是4000公顷。这里的土壤是肥沃的火山灰土。种植区的平均遮荫率为60%，有2个物种。种植区的这个地块的海拔高度为1500米，平均温度为19摄氏度，年降雨量是1700毫米。\n          </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n            咖农们采摘成熟的咖啡鲜果，用清水洗净，\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n           湿的咖啡鲜果铺成3厘米厚度的薄薄的一层，\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n           咖啡鲜果铺在非洲床上晾晒3天，再转移到厌氧状态下静置4天后将咖啡鲜果在非洲式晒床床上薄薄铺一层晾晒13天；\n           <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n            在整个干燥处理过程中要避免咖啡鲜果的果皮温度超过40摄氏度的高温，总\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n           处理时间为20天。\n          </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n             //\n            </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n</span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n             圣塔菲丽莎-绿洲庄园\n            </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n              Gesha2722\n             </span>\n             Lot53 日晒\n            </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          品种：瑰夏2722 Gesha2722\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          庄园\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          ：\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n          圣塔菲丽莎-绿洲庄园\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n          海拔：1550米 masl\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          批次：53\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n           处理方式：日晒 Natural\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          风味：花香、黄柠檬、西梅、蔓越莓、樱桃\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Floral, Lemon, Prune, Cranberry, Cherry\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          它的果香和果酸的丰富和层次比小矮人和非洲种更多元多变一些， 柠檬葡萄柚般复合着红色莓果，温度降下来一些后会转向成熟西梅般的圆润感，也有一些像蜂蜜柚子茶，余韵很甜很持久～\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n           这个是来自圣塔菲丽莎-绿洲庄园的微型地块。这片巴拿马瑰夏的种植区开垦于2012年，平均种植面积是2800公顷。这里的土壤是肥沃的火山灰土。种植区的平均遮荫率为70%，有8个物种。种植区的这个地块的海拔高度为1550米，平均温度为19摄氏度，年降雨量是1700毫米。\n          </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n           咖农们采摘成熟的咖啡鲜果，用清水洗净，后在密封的容器中放入酿酒酵母，静置18个小时后取出，分层铺在非洲式晾晒床上缓慢日晒37天。\n          </span>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TdCzdXa4ULuiaFVJqZibR0xibJjrCNLzW6rkx1N8NJ5Bict9YwsTAVtdJK6fbMibgym3iayK1WiciaUD14qQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 578px;height: 787px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          【庄园获奖记录】\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          2016年危地马拉CoE卓越杯，第二名 （Los Jutes）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          2017年危地马拉CoE卓越杯，第一名（El Paraxaj） &amp; 第八名（Santa Felisa）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          2019年危地马拉CoE卓越杯，第十一名（Chualax）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          2019年危地马拉CoE卓越杯，第十一名（Chualax）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          2020年危地马拉CoE卓越杯，第十三名（El Paraxaj）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          2022年危地马拉CoE卓越杯， 第五名（\n          <span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n           El Paraxaj\n          </span>\n          ）第二十名（\n          <span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n           Chualax\n          </span>\n          ）\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n           2023年危地马拉CoE卓越杯， 第二十四名（Los Jutes\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n           ）\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TdCzdXa4ULuiaFVJqZibR0xibY8syJGgcicELbMJlcTLxPsv0zpwplau15NhtLONIWTvj02BWnlLJLoA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n           关于圣塔菲蕾莎庄园 Santa Felisa\n          </strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          圣塔菲蕾莎庄园由Mr.Trinidad E. Cruz创立于1904年，位于危地马拉的阿卡特南果区域，与Antigua和Atilan接壤，周围有两座火山（Actenango和Fuego），也因此土壤受益火山的不定期喷发带来的火山灰矿物质；圣塔菲蕾莎除了主庄园Santa Felisa之外，旗下还有El Paraxaj，Los Jutes 和Chualax庄园。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TdCzdXa4ULuiaFVJqZibR0xibPu5icVzpryO6rnCT6mDicr4FLNO87jWooJT0C5aM3pkNJjj0zUk5mnag/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;zoom: 1;font-size: 14px;\">\n          圣塔菲蕾莎庄园除了友善环境的栽种方式以外，也非常重视与支持当地社区的平衡发展，庄园绝不使用童工，庄园内还设有一所小学，对在庄园工作的伙伴还提供下一代到高中的教育补助，也参与例如提供儿童餐饮、教育、医疗的Las Nubes Daycares公益计画。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TdCzdXa4ULuiaFVJqZibR0xibnj7aQRNRfckXjia1FRic9ABvSLEvkV5gHAVvHSNW4uCqh7uXIhfu6esg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;zoom: 1;font-size: 14px;\">\n          2011开始，现任经营者安东尼(Antonio Meneses)，决定办理庄园优质微批次的独立竞标，如同\n          <a data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%B7%B4%E6%8B%BF%E9%A9%AC%E5%\" style=\"outline: 0px;zoom: 1;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;zoom: 1;text-decoration: underline;\">\n            巴拿马\n           </span>\n</a>\n          的翡翠庄园般，这也是目前咖啡界少数的庄园单一竞标出现。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TdCzdXa4ULuiaFVJqZibR0xibHc9icPYpqFLu5OuEyUO2peeEaFXbEK7rqN5M6M8SLSJVKhHiaq5hyFuw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TdCzdXa4ULuiaFVJqZibR0xib35icbF7wFPticov3lqc9TkaHUq3KVicIn7v3EegAQWM0P5wmUaSdTjbUQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"10000\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
